                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "EfYCP",
                      "name": "Notes",
                      "width": 640,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 12,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "f0SBD1",
                          "name": "Notes heading",
                          "fill": "#1A1400",
                          "content": "Notes",
                          "fontFamily": "Schibsted Grotesk",
                          "fontSize": 20,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "sUpF9",
                          "name": "Notes body",
                          "fill": "#1A1A1A",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Algorithm: a height map built from three layers of smooth noise is sliced into contour lines every 0.045 units, like a topographic map. Marching squares on a 6 px grid turns each slice into line segments; every fifth line is drawn heavier.\n\nMotion: the terrain slides 5 px per second and reshapes slowly, so lines creep and never jitter.\n\nChecking: the ground around the button flattens into concentric rings that tighten from 34 to 11 px apart and pull inward; every fifth ring turns amber.\n\nRefused: a straight-line grating crosses the contours while the terrain tilts to almost match it, so a harsh moiré appears, holds 3.6 s, then relaxes.\n\nPalette: ground #0C1419, ink #9FB3BE, text #DDE6EA, accent Plex amber #E5A00D.\nFont: IBM Plex Mono.\nCost: about 7 ms a frame at 1440×900, so 60 fps with no half-res trick.\n\nNext: let the pointer press a slight dent into the terrain.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "IBM Plex Mono",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
